<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>What {{brandName}} will do for your club</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; background-color: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">

    <div style="background: #111827; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #00ff90;">{{brandName}}</h1>
    </div>

    <div style="padding: 30px 20px;">
      <p style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Hi {{#if name}}{{name}}{{else}}there{{/if}},</p>

      <p>I wanted to give you a preview of what {{brandName}} will look like when it launches.</p>

      <p>We are building four core pillars to cover everything a swim club needs:</p>

      <div style="margin: 25px 0;">
        <div style="padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;">
          <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">Member Management</p>
          <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: #64748B; font-size: 14px;">Members, families, squads, and roles, all organised and searchable. No more scattered spreadsheets.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;">
          <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">Session Scheduling</p>
          <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: #64748B; font-size: 14px;">Timetables, attendance registers, and lane assignments. Coaches see who is coming, parents get reminders.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;">
          <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">Automated Payments</p>
          <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: #64748B; font-size: 14px;">Direct Debit collection, invoicing, and payment tracking. No more chasing parents for fees.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 16px 0;">
          <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">Parent Communications</p>
          <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: #64748B; font-size: 14px;">Updates, consent forms, and notifications through a proper parent portal instead of WhatsApp groups.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #F0FDF4; border-left: 4px solid #00ff90; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 4px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #166534; font-weight: 600;">The Founding Club Programme</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; color: #166534;">As a waitlist member, you will be first in line for our founding club programme. That means early access to the platform, direct input on the features we prioritise, and preferential pricing that is locked in permanently.</p>
      </div>

      <p>We are getting closer to launch every day. More details soon.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
        Cheers,<br>
        <strong>Mike</strong><br>
        <span style="color: #64748B;">Founder of {{brandName}}</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #F8FAFC; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #64748B; font-size: 13px;">
      <p style="margin: 5px 0;">&copy; {{year}} {{brandName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}" style="color: #64748B; text-decoration: underline;">Unsubscribe</a></p>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
